  "relation": "triangle vertex sets and raw two-element subsets: Packing U9 is_triangle and X5 x5_is_triangle (clique T /\\ #|T| = 3) convert to GTBase.triangles.triangle T; Chromatic X69 x69_triangle (#|T| = 3 /\\ clique T) equals it by triangle_card_firstE (an iff, the conjunction order differs); Extremal X4 x4_triangle_set ((#|T| == 3) && cliqueb T) converts to triangle_set T, reflected by triangleP; Packing U9 tri_edges, X5 x5_tri_edges and Extremal XE2 xe2_tri_edges ([set e | (e \\subset T) && (#|e| == 2)], every two-subset, adjacent or not) convert to raw_pairs T. Raw pairs are graph edges only under an explicit clique guard (raw_pairs_cliqueE); a triangle set is not the graph-level triangle_free.",
