  "summary": [
    "Batch A, family A19 (triangle vertex sets and raw pairs), on the fixed A18 pin 748b76a (no private union). New GTBase.triangles names thin presentations over upstream clique/cliqueb and MathComp sets: triangle_set (Boolean, cardinality first), triangle (Prop, clique first) and raw_pairs (every two-subset of a supplied set). No clique predicate or packing/transversal abstraction is added. API: reflection, the cardinality-first order, raw-pair membership and count 'C(#|T|,2), empty raw support below two vertices, raw pairs = edges under a clique guard, a triangle's three pairs and three distinct adjacent vertices. Six sources convert; X69's cardinality-first Prop is an iff. The public client: K_3 is a triangle and its raw pairs are its edges, K_4 is not, small sets have no raw pair, a nonadjacent pair still has one, and three edgeless vertices have three raw pairs but no triangle.",
    "",
    "Frozen verbatim at 748b76a: the seven sources, eleven chains (X69 distance; X4 at-most-one-edge, hits-every, attained alpha1 and tau1; XE1 seven-set, clique property and greatest guarantee; XE2 and X5 edge-disjoint packings; X5 genuine-edge transversal) and seven rows (X69 Havel, X4 #621, XE1 #128 and #813, XE2 #1009, U9 with its unrestricted transversal S, X5 #167). Bounds, attained extrema, quantifier orders, natural subtraction/division, small-order vacuity and leg states are unchanged. Complete rows: X4 #621 and X5 #167 at the pre-M1 061154c over M1's frozen edge sets (X5 reusing the frozen packing chain), XE1 #128 and XE2 #1009 at A7's ae0e605 over A7's frozen edge count (XE2 reusing the frozen packing chain): eleven whole-row iffs in all. The complete bridges reuse M1's and A7's certificates.",
    "",
    "History: A7's XE1Legacy #128 and XE2Legacy #1009 keep the live triangle family byte-for-byte and are documented below; A19's per-row #128/#1009 copies keep A7's live edge count and are documented reciprocally in A7's spec; per-row X4/X5 copies keep M1's live edge aliases (M1 has no spec). A17's frozen Legacy.x4_triangle_set and its x4_triangle_set_compat consumer are unchanged (still a conversion). The five grounding_U9 lemmas, the vocabulary_packing bridges and A7's two row certificates keep their types. Doc blocks are unchanged."
  ],
